.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247693869&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=ff878dc84e4a1a2c2436659c0146a3d6&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">Agent全面爆发！万字长文详解上下文工程</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247695017&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=e37650a0f3334a69646fea9959c0297e&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">Harness Engineering 来了，SDD 还有意义吗？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247694687&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=933681fb58bd38e6af584388def1516a&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">RAG优化字典：20种RAG优化方法全解析</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247694816&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=5d796cf823344314aa4dd99163ceef5c&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">兄弟！你真的懂 Skill 吗？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247694343&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=8974e62e0c74a0011c6fdf6d037f957c&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">解构Clawdbot：本地架构、记忆管理、Agent 编排与上下文组装原理</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247694641&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=dff67991264624bf2e7615bd637f4cf6&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">如何从零开始实现一个 AI Agent 框架（理论+实践）</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247695342&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=9e3b38d4ea0d20c2ec1e46aa87a5fba3&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">万字干货！Harness Engineering如何工程化落地？</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247697464&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=809c710e2b0a2392b16ebb5635121d6d&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">Prompt越长越好吗？研究告诉你何时该停手</a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDU4OTExOQ==&#x26;mid=2247697254&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=4c6c7051662b7a92a77ce80bec68af16&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" class=\"\" target=\"_bl